  ($nbv$Q_NBV25_TNKQ23_C20$nbv$, $nbv$(Sở Bắc Ninh 2025) Nếu $\int_0^{\frac{\pi}{2}} f(x)dx = -5$ thì $\int_0^{\frac{\pi}{2}} \left[f(x) + \sin x\right]dx$ bằng$nbv$, $nbv$multiple_choice$nbv$, 1, $nbv$NB$nbv$, $nbv$TNKQ23.TÍCH PHÂN$nbv$, $nbv$Ta có $\int_0^{\frac{\pi}{2}} \sin x dx = -\cos\dfrac{\pi}{2} + \cos 0 = 1$.

