- d) $S = \int_0^5 \left|\left(\dfrac{3}{4}x^4 - 5x^3 - \dfrac{3}{2}x^2 + 15x\right) - \left(-\dfrac{3}{2}x^2 + 15x\right)\right|dx = \int_0^5 \left|\dfrac{3}{4}x^4 - 5x^3\right|dx = \int_0^5 \left(5x^3 - \dfrac{3}{4}x^4\right)dx = \dfrac{3125}{4} - \dfrac{1875}{4} = \dfrac{625}{2}$. Mệnh đề đúng.$nbv$, $nbv$\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.75cm,y=1cm,>=stealth,font=\small]
